      "content": "It is understandable that clinical labels don't capture the depth of what you are feeling right now, and the sense of weightlessness is truly frightening. Please remember that these intense feelings are symptoms, not permanent definitions of who you are or your inherent value. If the darkness feels too heavy, reaching out to a crisis line can provide immediate, non-judgmental human connection whenever you feel like you might just disappear.",
