      "content": "it just feels like so much noise. everything is so loud and meaningless and i'm just tired of pretending to be a person. if a program has an error that just breaks the whole thing, sometimes the only way to fix it is to just shut it down and clear the cache. it feels like my existence is just... bad code. shouldn't a system just delete something that isn't working right?",
